- {(m+1)!v_0\prod_iw_i},
- \qquad
- D_A(H)\le\frac{(AH+S)^m}{m!\prod_iw_i}.
+ n_\lambda\approx\frac{\nu}{2c}(UH-w\lambda)_+.
 \]
